sequenceDiagram
    participant V as Pet.vue
    participant A as App(GetPetGrowth)
    participant S as Service
    participant D as SQLite

    V->>A: syncGrowth() → GetPetGrowth()
    A->>S: svc.GetPetGrowth()
    S->>S: ActiveScenario()
    alt 无启用场景
        S-->>A: PetGrowth{Growth:0}
    else 有场景
        S->>S: ListReminders(scenarioID)
        S->>D: completedByReminder(now, today)
        S->>S: sumTodayTotals(reminders, counts, today)
        S->>S: growthTier(done, target)
        S-->>A: PetGrowth{done,target,growth}
    end
    A-->>V: PetGrowth
    V->>V: growth = g.growth（失败则保持原值）
    V->>V: class pet--growth-N 应用（静态形态 scale/rotate）
